# Test ASCII variants

# Numbers

Chiqish yozish: (2 !=: 3), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (2 <=: 2), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (2 >=: 2), yangi-qator.

# Strings

Chiqish yozish: (['b'] >=: ['a']), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['b'] !=: ['a']), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['b'] <=: ['c']), yangi-qator.

# Bools

Chiqish yozish: (Rost !=: Yolgʻon), yangi-qator.

# Objects

Chiqish yozish: (Obyekt yangi !=: Obyekt yangi), yangi-qator.

# ASCII list symbol <-:

Chiqish yozish: (Roʻyxat <<: 1, ; 2 ; 3) soni = 3, yangi-qator.

